{"created": "2026-09-05T20:27:28.205796+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-05T20:27:28.479417+00:00", "id": 22306254, "conceptrecid": "22306253", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22306254", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22306253", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22306254", "metadata": {"title": "pump.fun On-Chain Trading Dataset for Pump-and-Dump Detection (April\u2013May 2026)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22306254", "publication_date": "2026-09-04", "description": "<p>This dataset contains on-chain trading data collected from the pump.fun bonding-curve token launchpad on the Solana blockchain, covering the period 28 April 2026 to 29 May 2026. It was collected to support a supervised machine learning study on early detection of pump-and-dump (P&amp;D) schemes.</p>\n<p>The dataset comprisesA SQL database of pump.fun tokens with&nbsp; three components: (1) token-level metadata for 110,469 tokens observed during the collection period; (2) 20,731,091 individual on-chain trade records; and (3) pre-computed checkpoint feature vectors for 60,890 in-scope tokens across seven vSOL checkpoint levels (40, 45, 50, 55, 60, 65, 70 vSOL), including binary P&amp;D labels assigned by an automated labeller calibrated through human annotation.</p>\n<p>Data was collected via the Helius RPC WebSocket and stored in a SQLite database. Graduated tokens (vsol_peak &ge; 115 vSOL) and Mayhem Mode tokens are excluded from the supervised modelling set.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "van de Wouw, Niek", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["Solana", "pump.fun", "cryptocurrency"], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22306253"}}]}}, "title": "pump.fun On-Chain Trading Dataset for Pump-and-Dump Detection (April\u2013May 2026)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22306254", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22306254?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22306254", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22306254", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22306254", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306253", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22306253", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22306253", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22306253", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22306254/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22306254/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22306254/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22306254/q